 (text "LINUX MINIHOST A1 - PRODUCTION TEST / RECOVERY" (at 40 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b8000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000033"))
(text "TP1701: 2x5 bare-copper pogo array for power rails; no connector is fitted" (at 40 43 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b8000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000034"))
(text "Pin 2 = PD_15V_IN (15V). Measurement only: do not inject external voltage into any rail pad." (at 40 56 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b8000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000035"))
(text "VCCIO_SD may switch between 1.8V and 3.3V; measure its actual state before probing." (at 40 69 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b8000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000036"))
(text "TP1702: 2x7 bare-copper pogo array for UART2, PMIC control, recovery and MCU-JTAG mux signals" (at 40 205 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b8000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000037"))
(text "MCU_JTAG pins are multiplexed with 40-pin GPIO/I2C1/UART0 nets; they are NOT the ARM CPU JTAG port." (at 40 218 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b8000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000038"))
(text "Select MCU_JTAG pinmux before using pads 9-13; shared GPIO-header functions are unavailable while JTAG is active." (at 40 231 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b8000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000039"))
(text "ADC_RECOVERY and RECOVERY_SW are probe-only control nets; do not drive them from a fixture." (at 40 244 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b8000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000003a"))
(text "UART2 is 3.3V TTL. Connect fixture ground first; never apply 5V to signal pads." (at 40 257 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b8000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000003b"))
(text "POWER RAIL TEST ARRAY" (at 205 85 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b8000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000003c"))
(text "DEBUG / RECOVERY TEST ARRAY" (at 205 245 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b8000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000003d"))
